        "ai_gen_block_c88e324_m8PFU4": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_c88e324",
          "settings": {
            "container_width": 1200,
            "left_column_width": 40,
            "right_column_width": 60,
            "column_gap": 40,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "heading": "What We Make",
            "heading_font": "serif",
            "heading_size": 56,
            "mobile_heading_size": 40,
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "heading_indent": 25,
            "mobile_heading_indent": 40,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/perfume_3_jpg.jpg",
            "image_max_width": 600,
            "heading_image_gap": 4,
            "mobile_heading_image_gap": 25,
            "body_text": "<p>Inspired by: not a copy of, not a knockoff. Each one is developed using high-quality fragrance oils to capture the character, the warmth, the notes, and the longevity of the original. The kind of scent that has people asking what you are wearing. At around $20 a bottle, it is something you can wear every day, take to a festival, pack for a trip, or keep in your gym bag without a second thought.</p><p>We also believe that this kind of quality should be accessible to everyone. People with every kind of budget. People who walk into a department store and people who never set foot in one. </p><p>Great fragrance should be something anybody can reach for. That is not a side note. It is the whole point.</p>",
            "body_font": "system_ui_n4",
            "body_size": 24,
            "mobile_body_size": 16,
            "body_color": "#000000",
            "paragraph_spacing": 30,
            "mobile_paragraph_spacing": 15,
