    "1778690749e24fd023": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_fb81b45",
          "settings": {
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "max_width": 1200,
            "section_padding": 20,
            "background_color": "#f9f6f1",
            "heading": "<p>Why Quality Is The Whole Thing</p>",
            "heading_size": 60,
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "heading_spacing": 10,
            "box_color": "#8b1d22",
            "box_radius": 25,
            "box_padding": 40,
            "box_spacing": 10,
            "box_paragraph_1": "<p>The<a href=\"https://scentspired.com/\" title=\"https://scentspired.com/\"> inspired fragrance</a> space is not all the same, and the difference shows up fast. The single biggest variable between a fragrance that performs and one that fades out by mid-morning is the quality of the fragrance oil. We do not cut corners there. </p>",
            "box_paragraph_2": "<p>The formulation, the concentration, the way a scent develops on your skin throughout the day: these are the things we are focused on getting right every time.</p>",
            "box_paragraph_3": "<p>The presentation matters too. Scentspired does not look or feel like a budget option, because it is not one. It is a quality product at a price that makes sense. There is a difference, and we think it shows.<br/><br/></p>",
            "box_text_color": "#ffffff",
            "box_text_size": 24,
            "box_text_line_height": 1.6,
            "paragraph_spacing": 25,
            "subheading": "<p>The word you will not find here</p>",
            "subheading_size": 60,
            "subheading_color": "#000000",
            "subheading_spacing": 10,
            "bottom_text": "<p>We do not use the word dupe anywhere on this site. That word suggests a cheap imitation trying to pass itself off as something it is not. What we make is different. Our fragrances are inspired by great perfumery, developed with quality ingredients, and sold with full transparency about what the inspiration is. We are not hiding it. We are proud of it. What we are offering is the experience of a fragrance you love, made well, at a price that lets you actually enjoy it.</p>",
            "bottom_text_size": 24,
            "bottom_text_color": "#000000",
            "bottom_text_line_height": 1.6
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA"
